      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WANDJAD (3) will be chasing the hatrick and there is no reason he can't do it. He contests a race which is hardly much harder and put nearly three lengths on them last time. If anything the added 50m is only in his favour. All he needs is some speed on and he is the one to beat. RING AHOY (1) is another who will be back in the field but is capable of finding the line. He will carry a bit of weight which is never easy. Does have a more experienced rider up. HINTO (5) is one who will probably sit on the speed. He boxed on pretty well at Tamworth. Will be at peak fitness now. NUGGET SMART (6) will be nearby in running. He has placed both attempts this track. Looks to be the play again. DISCO PRINCE (2) was too bad to be true resuming. Prior prep was very solid so go off that.",
